WEBVTT

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:02.016
in which I applied my own color palette
to my own neighborhoods

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.560
in my own way.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:10.136
Now, if I walked down
79th Street right now

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:16.760
and I asked 50 people for the name
of the slightly greener shade of cyan,

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.936
they would look at me sideways.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:20.976
(Laughter)

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.176
But if I say, "What color
is Ultra Sheen?" --

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.136
oh, a smile emerges,

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:29.280
stories about their
grandmother's bathroom ensue.